OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife park celebrates first
OL,4,AHighland calf birth
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wildlife park is celebrating the
OL,7,Fbirth of a Highland calf, believed to
OL,8,Fbe the first in its history, as it
OL,9,Fmarks its 70th anniversary.
OL,11,FMaggie was born overnight on 1 October
OL,12,Fat Beale Wildlife Park in Lower
OL,13,FBasildon, near Pangbourne in Berkshire.
OL,15,FKeeper Dougie Ford said she had settled
OL,16,Fin "really, really well" and bonded
OL,17,Fquickly with the rest of the herd.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
